target: skills/review/review-loop/review-stats.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./review-stats.test.sh
expect: FAIL  a gate failing both ways still raises
why:    thresholding the two buckets independently and nothing else takes a gate from 3 non-completions to raise to 5 — two of each is four, and silent. The split names the right fix; it must not make a thrashing gate cheaper to ignore
